id: movement-instant
name: Movement (Instant)
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# Opened by an effect that lets the Movement Maneuver be used "as an Instant Maneuver" once a Round (Exponential Power (1)); the
# Movement itself out of sequence, its Ki paid (chat.mjs instantOneOf).
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  The Movement Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver, where an effect allows it.
text: >
  During your turn, you may use the Movement Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: The Movement Maneuver's
  –Effect: The Movement Maneuver, out of sequence.

---

[on used]
instantOneOf(movement);
